1
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:36,000
A husband. A wife. A millionaire. A proposal.

2
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Indecent Proposal is a romance, drama film directed by Adrian Lyne.

3
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:36,000
John Gage offers a down-on-his-luck yuppie husband $1 million for the
opportunity to spend the night with the man's wife.

4
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
John Gage, played by Robert Redford.

5
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:36,000
Diana Murphy, played by Demi Moore.

6
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
David Murphy, played by Woody Harrelson.

7
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Mr. Shackleford, played by Seymour Cassel.

8
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
