9
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
Day Tripper, played by Billy Bob Thornton.

10
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Indecent Proposal is a 1993 American erotic drama film directed
by Adrian Lyne and written by Amy Holden Jones.

11
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
It is based on the 1988 novel by Jack Engelhard, in which a couple's marriage is disrupted by a
stranger's offer of a million dollars for the wife to spend the night with him.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
It stars Robert Redford, Demi Moore, and Woody Harrelson.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
The film received a mostly negative response from critics for the
contrivances and implausibilities of its story.

14
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
It also sparked controversy, with feminists arguing the film's premise
promotes prostitution and the treatment of women as property.

15
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
Despite this, the film was a box office success and grossed nearly $267 million worldwide
on a $38 million budget, becoming the sixth highest-grossing film of 1993.

16
01:44:00,000 --> 01:44:06,000
The film explores themes of adultery, love of one's
life, gambling, roulette, las vegas.

17
01:50:30,000 --> 01:50:36,000
The tone is emotional.
